{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/extras/9a4c6b78283593de5418dc7e332f9b61.avif?t=1761245936\" width=1008 height=248 /></span><strong>Simple Rules, Deep Logic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill circular puzzles with the correct numbers using just three simple rules. Rondoku is a calm and minimalist logic game that invites you to slow down, think carefully, and find satisfaction in clever solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/extras/rondoku_steam_gif_diagram.png?t=1761245936\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>70 Hand-Crafted Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in Rondoku is designed by hand. With 70 unique levels, the game offers a thoughtful difficulty curve and a sense of intention in every diagram.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Puzzle Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic puzzle magazines, Rondoku is presented as a book. Flip through its pages freely and enjoy the quiet satisfaction of solving each puzzle, one by one, until the book is complete.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3791600/c0915e31ded5bae66e3b0551466d00c02549164d.jpg"},{"name":"3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3791600/0e8f49bdb73d601e95e8f3fa7741e2ca0967c148.jpg"},{"name":"5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3791600/c625abdd8078b6fc8d98ffe14a0b4270a48dbe22.jpg"},{"name":"7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3791600/0624da38bbb7e3513cd7137f37b46e149097f626.jpg"},{"name":"1